  "content": "<p><time datetime=\"2026-10-29T15:45:04+03:00\">29.10.2026 / 18:45</time></p>\n                                        \n                        <p>Minsk residents who went for a walk on October 28 might have noticed an unusual glow in the sky. Belarusians in different parts of the city observed both single and paired pillars of light. According to eyewitnesses, such light sources \"appeared and disappeared,\" \n<a href=\"https://tech.onliner.by/2026/10/29/illyuziya-anomaliya-nlo-v-minske-na-nebe-zametili-zagadochnoe-svechenie\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">writes</a>\n \"Onliner.\"\n</p>\n                        <figure><img src=\"https://nashaniva.com/img/w840d4webp1/photos/z_2026_10/2026-10-29173912-15td8.jpg.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"840\" height=\"420\" /></figure>                    \n                    \n                                                <p>In Threads, people began to guess what it was — an anomaly, an illusion, or even a spaceship? Such conjectures sound interesting, but reality is much more prosaic.</p><blockquote> <a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@juliamark_photo/post/DfDK4JOjX23\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"> <p> Смотреть в Threads</p></a></blockquote>\n<p>Light pillars that appeared in the air are an atmospheric optical phenomenon. It occurs because light from streetlights, searchlights, or other bright sources reflects off the facets of tiny flat ice crystals suspended in the air.</p><blockquote> <a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@inna_daneika/post/DfETECgCJ9-\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"> <p> Смотреть в Threads</p></a></blockquote>\n\n<p>As a result, it appears to the observer that a vertical pillar of light extends upwards or downwards from the light source. Such pillars can be yellow, orange, white, or reddish.</p><blockquote> <a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@lawyerladeeva/post/DfDW7brgC7d\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"> <p> Смотреть в Threads</p></a></blockquote>\n\n                        \n                                                \n                        \n                                                                                \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                    \n                    \n                \n                <a></a>\n                \n                                    \n                                                    \n                            <h4>Now reading</h4>\n                            \n                                                                                                                                                        \n\n    \n            <h2>\"Does a Negro decide how indigenous Belarusians should behave?\" Former political prisoner Vishniak lashed out at Alana Gebremariam\n<a href=\"https://nashaniva.com/en/408053#startcomments\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">10</a><a href=\"https://nashaniva.com/en/408053/comments\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">10</a></h2>\n            <p><img src=\"https://nashaniva.com/img/w450h300crop1webp1/photos/z_2026_10/untitledproject-2026-10-29t171016761-k5cr8.jpg.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" />\n        </p>\n    \n    \n\n                                                                                                                                                            \n\n    \n            <h2>Residential Complex Construction Begins Near \"Belarusfilm\" in Minsk\n<a href=\"https://nashaniva.com/en/408070#startcomments\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">3</a><a href=\"https://nashaniva.com/en/408070/comments\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">3</a></h2>\n            <p><img src=\"https://nashaniva.com/img/w450h300crop1webp1/photos/z_2026_10/content_makaenkadom2-m2jma.jpg.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"asyn